        {
          "text": "Na kwasemba mũndũ wa Mbenyamini kuma nguthunĩ ya kaũ, na avika Silo mũthenya o ũsu, ngũa syake syĩ ndembũange, na mũthanga ĩũlũ wa mũtwe wake. ",
